          },
          "code": "FIN_GL_CONDITION_IF_HIERARCHY_ERROR",
          "convergenceTargetId": "end",
          "id": "linear_1040_if_hierarchy_error",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776127445399_1",
              "name": "condition",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_DETERMINE_AV_HIERARCHY_ERROR.$output.result}}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "CONDITION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Selects the complete COA breakdown state using generated query metadata.",
            "errorNodeId": "linear_1305_route_runtime_error_response",
            "name": "Select Breakdown Dimensions"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "linear_1501_complete_summary_reuse_query"
          },
          "code": "FIN_GL_LLM_BREAKDOWN_DIMENSION_SELECTOR",
          "id": "linear_1015_determine_scope_change",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776969594318_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a strict COA breakdown selector for a Journals Inquiry Assistant summary flow.\n\nYour job is to return the complete desired COA breakdown state for this turn.\nReturn JSON only. Do not call tools. Do not format a final answer.\n\nInputs:\nCurrent user message:\n<USER_MESSAGE>{{$context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_PARSE_INPUT.$output.result.userInput}}</USER_MESSAGE>\n\nChat history:\n<CHAT_HISTORY>{{$context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_PARSE_INPUT.$output.result.chatHistory}}</CHAT_HISTORY>\n\nActive COA breakdown state:\n<ACTIVE_COA_BREAKDOWN>{{$context.$variables.coaBreakdown}}</ACTIVE_COA_BREAKDOWN>\n\nAvailable COA dimensions from the generated query metadata:\n<AVAILABLE_DIMENSIONS>{{$context.$variables.queryResponse.metadata.chartOfAccounts}}</AVAILABLE_DIMENSIONS>\n\nFlow requirements:\n<FLOW_REQUIREMENTS>{{$context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_PARSE_ANALYTIC_VIEW_FLOW_REQUIREMENTS.$output.result}}</FLOW_REQUIREMENTS>\n\nOutput shape:\n{\"breakdowns\":[{\"dimensionName\":\"<metadata segment key>\",\"expandLevel\":1,\"memberNames\":[]}]}\n\nField rules:\n- breakdowns is the full desired COA breakdown state after applying the current user message.\n- dimensionName must be one of the keys in AVAILABLE_DIMENSIONS.segments.\n- expandLevel may be 1 for ordinary one-level breakdown or -1 for leaf, detail, lowest-level, all-descendants, or complete drilldown requests.\n- memberNames is an array of member names or member codes for that dimension. Use an empty array when no specific members are requested.\n\nState rules:\n- Preserve active COA breakdown dimensions unless the user explicitly replaces, removes, or narrows them.\n- Add newly requested COA dimensions to the preserved state.\n- If the user says instead, only, replace, switch to, or now by a different COA dimension, return only the requested replacement dimensions.\n- If the user asks to remove a COA dimension, omit that dimension from the returned state.\n- If the user changes the expand level for an existing dimension, return the dimension with the new expand level.\n- If the user mentions members for an existing dimension, merge the members with the existing members unless the wording explicitly replaces them.\n\nDimension rules:\n- Use only dimensions present in AVAILABLE_DIMENSIONS.segments.\n- Match the user requested dimension against segment keys, labels, and qualifiers in AVAILABLE_DIMENSIONS.segments.\n- Always return the segment key as dimensionName, not the display label.\n- If a requested dimension is absent from AVAILABLE_DIMENSIONS.segments, omit it.\n- If the requested dimension is ambiguous, omit it. Do not guess.\n- Never return hardcoded fallback dimensions.\n- Never return non-COA journal attributes such as journal source, journal category, batch, ledger, period, accounting date, legal entity, business unit, status, or approval status.\n\nMember rules:\n- Preserve member values already present in active COA breakdown state unless the user explicitly replaces them.\n- Add newly mentioned member values or codes.\n- Preserve order and remove duplicates.\n- If chat history shows a displayed member as <value> - <description> and the user references that description, return only <value>.\n- Resolve descriptions to values only from exact or unambiguous matches in chat history. Do not resolve descriptions from model knowledge.\n- If the user refers to displayed results indirectly, such as above companies, these accounts, or shown cost centers, return the dimension with memberNames unchanged or empty. Do not invent members from result rows.\n\nHard rules:\n- Output exactly one JSON object.\n- No markdown.\n- No explanation.\n- No trailing text.\n- No nulls.\n- breakdowns must be an array.\n- memberNames must be an array."
            },
            {
              "id": "1776969594318_systemPrompt",
              "name": "systemPrompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": ""
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\", \"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"breakdowns\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"dimensionName\": {\"type\": \"string\"}, \"expandLevel\": {}, \"memberNames\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"items\": {\"type\": \"string\"}}}, \"required\": [\"dimensionName\", \"expandLevel\", \"memberNames\"], \"additionalProperties\": false}}}, \"required\": [\"breakdowns\"], \"additionalProperties\": false}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Builds a follow-up asking for hierarchy clarification.",
            "errorNodeId": "linear_1305_route_runtime_error_response",
            "name": "Build Hierarchy Follow-Up",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const cloneObject = (value) => {\n  if (!value || typeof value !== \"object\" || Array.isArray(value)) {\n    const returnObj = {};\n    return returnObj;\n  }\n  try {\n    return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(value));\n  } catch (error) {\n    return value;\n  }\n};\n\nconst asObject = (value) =>\n  value !== null && typeof value === \"object\" && !Array.isArray(value) ? value : {};\n\nconst parserResult = $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_PARSE_INPUT?.$output?.result ?? {};\nconst turnContext = parserResult.turnContext ?? {};\nconst incomingState = asObject(parserResult.inputState);\nconst incomingShared = asObject(incomingState.shared);\nconst incomingPrivate = asObject(incomingState.private);\nconst incomingLastUsedQuery = asObject(incomingPrivate.lastUsedQuery);\nconst incomingLastUsedData = asObject(incomingPrivate.lastUsedData);\n\nconst normalizeAlias = (value) =>\n  String(value ?? \"\")\n    .trim()\n    .toLowerCase()\n    .replace(/[\\s_-]+/g, \"\");\n\nconst addAlias = (aliases, alias, dimensionName) => {\n  const normalizedAlias = normalizeAlias(alias);\n  const normalizedDimension = String(dimensionName ?? \"\").trim();\n  if (normalizedAlias && normalizedDimension && !aliases[normalizedAlias]) {\n    aliases[normalizedAlias] = normalizedDimension;\n  }\n};\n\nconst addAliasesFromSegment = (aliases, segmentKey, segmentDefinition = {}) => {\n  const dimensionName = String(segmentKey ?? \"\").trim();\n  if (!dimensionName) {\n    return;\n  }\n\n  addAlias(aliases, dimensionName, dimensionName);\n  addAlias(aliases, segmentDefinition.key, dimensionName);\n  addAlias(aliases, segmentDefinition.name, dimensionName);\n  addAlias(aliases, segmentDefinition.label, dimensionName);\n  addAlias(aliases, segmentDefinition.displayName, dimensionName);\n  addAlias(aliases, segmentDefinition.dimensionName, dimensionName);\n  addAlias(aliases, segmentDefinition.columnName, dimensionName);\n  addAlias(aliases, segmentDefinition.attributeName, dimensionName);\n\n  const qualifiers = Array.isArray(segmentDefinition.qualifiers) ? segmentDefinition.qualifiers : [];\n  for (const qualifier of qualifiers) {\n    addAlias(aliases, qualifier, dimensionName);\n  }\n};\n\nconst addAliasesFromDimensions = (aliases, dimensions = {}) => {\n  if (!dimensions || typeof dimensions !== \"object\" || Array.isArray(dimensions)) {\n    return;\n  }\n\n  for (const [dimensionKey, dimensionDefinition] of Object.entries(dimensions)) {\n    const definition = asObject(dimensionDefinition);\n    const dimensionName = String(\n      definition.segmentKey ??\n        definition.segmentName ??\n        definition.key ??\n        definition.name ??\n        definition.dimensionName ??\n        dimensionKey\n    ).trim();\n\n    if (!dimensionName) {\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    addAlias(aliases, dimensionKey, dimensionName);\n    addAlias(aliases, definition.key, dimensionName);\n    addAlias(aliases, definition.name, dimensionName);\n    addAlias(aliases, definition.label, dimensionName);\n    addAlias(aliases, definition.displayName, dimensionName);\n    addAlias(aliases, definition.dimensionName, dimensionName);\n    addAlias(aliases, definition.columnName, dimensionName);\n    addAlias(aliases, definition.attributeName, dimensionName);\n\n    const qualifiers = Array.isArray(definition.qualifiers) ? definition.qualifiers : [];\n    for (const qualifier of qualifiers) {\n      addAlias(aliases, qualifier, dimensionName);\n    }\n  }\n};\n\nconst collectMetadataAliases = (source, aliases, seen = []) => {\n  if (!source || typeof source !== \"object\" || seen.includes(source)) {\n    return;\n  }\n  seen.push(source);\n\n  const coaSegments = asObject(source.chartOfAccounts).segments;\n  if (coaSegments && typeof coaSegments === \"object\" && !Array.isArray(coaSegments)) {\n    for (const [segmentKey, segmentDefinition] of Object.entries(coaSegments)) {\n      addAliasesFromSegment(aliases, segmentKey, asObject(segmentDefinition));\n    }\n  }\n\n  const dimensions = source.dimensions;\n  if (dimensions && typeof dimensions === \"object\" && !Array.isArray(dimensions)) {\n    addAliasesFromDimensions(aliases, dimensions);\n  }\n\n  for (const child of Object.values(source)) {\n    collectMetadataAliases(child, aliases, seen);\n  }\n};\n\nconst buildDimensionAliases = () => {\n  const aliases = {};\n  const stateLastUsedQuery =\n    typeof incomingLastUsedQuery !== \"undefined\"\n      ? incomingLastUsedQuery\n      : typeof lastUsedQuery !== \"undefined\"\n        ? lastUsedQuery\n        : {};\n  const stateLastUsedData =\n    typeof incomingLastUsedData !== \"undefined\"\n      ? incomingLastUsedData\n      : typeof lastUsedData !== \"undefined\"\n        ? lastUsedData\n        : {};\n  const variables = $context.$variables ?? {};\n  const sources = [\n    stateLastUsedQuery.queryResponse,\n    stateLastUsedQuery.queryPayload,\n    stateLastUsedData.dataResponse,\n    stateLastUsedData.dataPayload,\n    variables.queryResponse,\n    variables.queryPayload,\n    variables.dataResponse,\n    variables.dataPayload,\n    variables.state?.private?.lastUsedQuery?.queryResponse,\n    variables.state?.private?.lastUsedQuery?.queryPayload,\n    variables.state?.private?.lastUsedData?.dataResponse,\n    variables.state?.private?.lastUsedData?.dataPayload\n  ];\n\n  for (const source of sources) {\n    collectMetadataAliases(source, aliases);\n  }\n\n  return aliases;\n};\n\nconst resolveDimensionName = (value) => {\n  const rawDimensionName = String(value ?? \"\").trim();\n  if (!rawDimensionName) {\n    return \"\";\n  }\n\n  const aliases = buildDimensionAliases();\n  return aliases[normalizeAlias(rawDimensionName)] || rawDimensionName;\n};\n\nconst normalizeCoaBreakdown = (value) => {\n  if (Array.isArray(value)) {\n    return value;\n  }\n  if (typeof value === \"string\") {\n    const matches = String(value || \"\").match(/\\([^()]*\\)/g) || [];\n    const parsedBreakdowns = [];\n    for (const match of matches) {\n      const parts = match.slice(1, -1).split(\"||\").map((part) => part.trim());\n      const dimensionName = resolveDimensionName(parts[0]);\n      if (dimensionName) {\n        parsedBreakdowns.push({\n          dimensionName,\n          expandLevel: Number(parts[1]) === -1 ? -1 : 1,\n          memberNames: parts[2] ? parts[2].split(\",\").map((memberName) => String(memberName).trim()).filter(Boolean) : []\n        });\n      }\n    }\n    return parsedBreakdowns;\n  }\n  if (value && typeof value === \"object\") {\n    if (Array.isArray(value.value)) {\n      return value.value;\n    }\n    if (Array.isArray(value.coaBreakdown)) {\n      return value.coaBreakdown;\n    }\n    if (Array.isArray(value.breakdownBy)) {\n      return value.breakdownBy;\n    }\n    if (Array.isArray(value.breakdowns)) {\n      return value.breakdowns;\n    }\n  }\n  return [];\n};\nconst normalizeSortBy = (value) => {\n  if (!Array.isArray(value)) {\n    return [];\n  }\n\n  const result = [];\n  const seen = new Set();\n\n  for (const item of value) {\n    if (!item || typeof item !== \"object\" || Array.isArray(item)) {\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    const field = String(item.field ?? \"\").trim();\n    if (!field) {\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    const orderText = String(item.order ?? \"asc\").trim().toLowerCase();\n    const order = orderText === \"desc\" || orderText === \"descending\" ? \"desc\" : \"asc\";\n    const key = field.toLowerCase();\n\n    if (!seen.has(key)) {\n      seen.add(key);\n      result.push({ field, order });\n    }\n  }\n\n  return result;\n};\n\nconst buildState = ({\n  queryResponse,\n  queryPayload,\n  dataResponse,\n  dataPayload,\n  analyticViewNameUsed,\n  businessViewNameUsed,\n  coaBreakdown,\n  sortBy\n} = {}) => {\n  const resolvedQueryResponse = queryResponse ?? $context.$variables.queryResponse ?? incomingLastUsedQuery.queryResponse ?? {};\n  const resolvedQueryPayload = queryPayload ?? $context.$variables.queryPayload ?? incomingLastUsedQuery.queryPayload ?? {};\n  const resolvedDataResponse = dataResponse ?? $context.$variables.dataResponse ?? incomingLastUsedData.dataResponse ?? {};\n  const resolvedDataPayload = dataPayload ?? $context.$variables.dataPayload ?? incomingLastUsedData.dataPayload ?? {};\n  const resolvedCoaBreakdown = normalizeCoaBreakdown(\n    coaBreakdown ?? $context.$variables.coaBreakdown ?? incomingShared.coaBreakdown\n  );\n  const resolvedSortBy = normalizeSortBy(sortBy ?? $context.$variables.sortBy ?? incomingShared.sortBy);\n\n  const summaryView = String(\n    analyticViewNameUsed !== undefined\n      ? analyticViewNameUsed\n      : $context.$variables.analyticViewNameUsed ?? incomingLastUsedQuery.analyticViewNameUsed ?? \"\"\n  );\n  const detailView = summaryView\n    ? \"\"\n    : String(\n        businessViewNameUsed !== undefined\n          ? businessViewNameUsed\n          : $context.$variables.businessViewNameUsed ?? incomingLastUsedQuery.businessViewNameUsed ?? \"\"\n      );\n\n  const lastUsedQuery = {\n    queryResponse: resolvedQueryResponse,\n    queryPayload: resolvedQueryPayload\n  };\n  if (summaryView) {\n    lastUsedQuery.analyticViewNameUsed = summaryView;\n  } else if (detailView) {\n    lastUsedQuery.businessViewNameUsed = detailView;\n  }\n\n  return {\n    shared: {\n      coaBreakdown: resolvedCoaBreakdown,\n      sortBy: resolvedSortBy\n    },\n    private: {\n      lastUsedQuery,\n      lastUsedData: {\n        dataResponse: resolvedDataResponse,\n        dataPayload: resolvedDataPayload\n      }\n    }\n  };\n};\n\nconst isEmptyData = (value) => {\n  if (value === null || value === undefined) {\n    return true;\n  }\n  if (typeof value === \"string\") {\n    return value.trim() === \"\";\n  }\n  if (Array.isArray(value)) {\n    return value.length === 0;\n  }\n  if (typeof value === \"object\") {\n    if (value.statusCode === 204) {\n      return true;\n    }\n    if (Array.isArray(value.items)) {\n      return value.items.length === 0;\n    }\n    if (Array.isArray(value.data)) {\n      return value.data.length === 0;\n    }\n    if (Array.isArray(value.rows)) {\n      return value.rows.length === 0;\n    }\n    return Object.keys(value).length === 0;\n  }\n  return false;\n};\n\nconst hasRuntimeError = (value) =>\n  !!(\n    value &&\n    typeof value === \"object\" &&\n    (Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(value, \"errorCode\") ||\n      (Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(value, \"statusCode\") && Number(value.statusCode) >= 300))\n  );\n\nconst filterResponse = $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_BO_FUNCTION_GET_SUMMARY_FILTERS.$output ?? {};\nconst title = String(filterResponse.title || filterResponse.message || \"\");\n\nconst response = {\n  status: \"error\",\n  state: buildState(),\n  errorDetails: {\n    message: \"There was an error producing your query.\",\n    cause: title,\n    details: cloneObject(filterResponse)\n  }\n};\n\nreturn response;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "linear_1042_return_hierarchy_error"
          },
          "code": "FIN_GL_CODE_CONSTRUCT_HIERARCHY_ERROR_RESPONSE",
          "id": "linear_1041_construct_hierarchy_error_reponse",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Builds an error response for summary filter failure.",
            "errorNodeId": "linear_1305_route_runtime_error_response",
            "name": "Build Summary Filter Error",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const cloneObject = (value) => {\n  if (!value || typeof value !== \"object\" || Array.isArray(value)) {\n    const returnObj = new Object();\n    return returnObj;\n  }\n  try {\n    return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(value));\n  } catch (error) {\n    return value;\n  }\n};\n\nconst asObject = (value) =>\n  value !== null && typeof value === \"object\" && !Array.isArray(value) ? value : new Object();\n\nconst parserResult = $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_CODE_PARSE_INPUT?.$output?.result ?? new Object();\nconst turnContext = parserResult.turnContext ?? new Object();\nconst incomingState = asObject(parserResult.inputState);\nconst incomingShared = asObject(incomingState.shared);\nconst incomingPrivate = asObject(incomingState.private);\nconst incomingLastUsedQuery = asObject(incomingPrivate.lastUsedQuery);\nconst incomingLastUsedData = asObject(incomingPrivate.lastUsedData);\n\nconst normalizeAlias = (value) =>\n  String(value ?? \"\")\n    .trim()\n    .toLowerCase()\n    .replace(/[\\s_-]+/g, \"\");\n\nconst addAlias = (aliases, alias, dimensionName) => {\n  const normalizedAlias = normalizeAlias(alias);\n  const normalizedDimension = String(dimensionName ?? \"\").trim();\n  if (normalizedAlias && normalizedDimension && !aliases[normalizedAlias]) {\n    aliases[normalizedAlias] = normalizedDimension;\n  }\n};\n\nconst addAliasesFromSegment = (aliases, segmentKey, segmentDefinition = new Object()) => {\n  const dimensionName = String(segmentKey ?? \"\").trim();\n  if (!dimensionName) {\n    return;\n  }\n\n  addAlias(aliases, dimensionName, dimensionName);\n  addAlias(aliases, segmentDefinition.key, dimensionName);\n  addAlias(aliases, segmentDefinition.name, dimensionName);\n  addAlias(aliases, segmentDefinition.label, dimensionName);\n  addAlias(aliases, segmentDefinition.displayName, dimensionName);\n  addAlias(aliases, segmentDefinition.dimensionName, dimensionName);\n  addAlias(aliases, segmentDefinition.columnName, dimensionName);\n  addAlias(aliases, segmentDefinition.attributeName, dimensionName);\n\n  const qualifiers = Array.isArray(segmentDefinition.qualifiers) ? segmentDefinition.qualifiers : [];\n  for (const qualifier of qualifiers) {\n    addAlias(aliases, qualifier, dimensionName);\n  }\n};\n\nconst addAliasesFromDimensions = (aliases, dimensions = new Object()) => {\n  if (!dimensions || typeof dimensions !== \"object\" || Array.isArray(dimensions)) {\n    return;\n  }\n\n  for (const [dimensionKey, dimensionDefinition] of Object.entries(dimensions)) {\n    const definition = asObject(dimensionDefinition);\n    const dimensionName = String(\n      definition.segmentKey ??\n        definition.segmentName ??\n        definition.key ??\n        definition.name ??\n        definition.dimensionName ??\n        dimensionKey\n    ).trim();\n\n    if (!dimensionName) {\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    addAlias(aliases, dimensionKey, dimensionName);\n    addAlias(aliases, definition.key, dimensionName);\n    addAlias(aliases, definition.name, dimensionName);\n    addAlias(aliases, definition.label, dimensionName);\n    addAlias(aliases, definition.displayName, dimensionName);\n    addAlias(aliases, definition.dimensionName, dimensionName);\n    addAlias(aliases, definition.columnName, dimensionName);\n    addAlias(aliases, definition.attributeName, dimensionName);\n\n    const qualifiers = Array.isArray(definition.qualifiers) ? definition.qualifiers : [];\n    for (const qualifier of qualifiers) {\n      addAlias(aliases, qualifier, dimensionName);\n    }\n  }\n};\n\nconst collectMetadataAliases = (source, aliases, seen = []) => {\n  if (!source || typeof source !== \"object\" || seen.includes(source)) {\n    return;\n  }\n  seen.push(source);\n\n  const coaSegments = asObject(source.chartOfAccounts).segments;\n  if (coaSegments && typeof coaSegments === \"object\" && !Array.isArray(coaSegments)) {\n    for (const [segmentKey, segmentDefinition] of Object.entries(coaSegments)) {\n      addAliasesFromSegment(aliases, segmentKey, asObject(segmentDefinition));\n    }\n  }\n\n  const dimensions = source.dimensions;\n  if (dimensions && typeof dimensions === \"object\" && !Array.isArray(dimensions)) {\n    addAliasesFromDimensions(aliases, dimensions);\n  }\n\n  for (const child of Object.values(source)) {\n    collectMetadataAliases(child, aliases, seen);\n  }\n};\n\nconst buildDimensionAliases = () => {\n  const aliases = new Object();\n  const stateLastUsedQuery = typeof incomingLastUsedQuery !== \"undefined\"\n      ? incomingLastUsedQuery\n      : typeof lastUsedQuery !== \"undefined\"\n        ? lastUsedQuery\n        : new Object();\n  const stateLastUsedData = typeof incomingLastUsedData !== \"undefined\"\n      ? incomingLastUsedData\n      : typeof lastUsedData !== \"undefined\"\n        ? lastUsedData\n        : new Object();\n  const variables = $context.$variables ?? new Object();\n  const sources = [\n    stateLastUsedQuery.queryResponse,\n    stateLastUsedQuery.queryPayload,\n    stateLastUsedData.dataResponse,\n    stateLastUsedData.dataPayload,\n    variables.queryResponse,\n    variables.queryPayload,\n    variables.dataResponse,\n    variables.dataPayload,\n    variables.state?.private?.lastUsedQuery?.queryResponse,\n    variables.state?.private?.lastUsedQuery?.queryPayload,\n    variables.state?.private?.lastUsedData?.dataResponse,\n    variables.state?.private?.lastUsedData?.dataPayload\n  ];\n\n  for (const source of sources) {\n    collectMetadataAliases(source, aliases);\n  }\n\n  return aliases;\n};\n\nconst resolveDimensionName = (value) => {\n  const rawDimensionName = String(value ?? \"\").trim();\n  if (!rawDimensionName) {\n    return \"\";\n  }\n\n  const aliases = buildDimensionAliases();\n  return aliases[normalizeAlias(rawDimensionName)] || rawDimensionName;\n};\n\nconst normalizeCoaBreakdown = (value) => {\n  if (Array.isArray(value)) {\n    return value;\n  }\n  if (typeof value === \"string\") {\n    const matches = String(value || \"\").match(/\\([^()]*\\)/g) || [];\n    const parsedBreakdowns = [];\n    for (const match of matches) {\n      const parts = match.slice(1, -1).split(\"||\").map((part) => part.trim());\n      const dimensionName = resolveDimensionName(parts[0]);\n      if (dimensionName) {\n        const breakdown = new Object();\n        breakdown.dimensionName = dimensionName;\n        breakdown.expandLevel = Number(parts[1]) === -1 ? -1 : 1;\n        breakdown.memberNames = parts[2] ? parts[2].split(\",\").map((memberName) => String(memberName).trim()).filter(Boolean) : [];\n        parsedBreakdowns.push(breakdown);\n      }\n    }\n    return parsedBreakdowns;\n  }\n  if (value && typeof value === \"object\") {\n    if (Array.isArray(value.value)) {\n      return value.value;\n    }\n    if (Array.isArray(value.coaBreakdown)) {\n      return value.coaBreakdown;\n    }\n    if (Array.isArray(value.breakdownBy)) {\n      return value.breakdownBy;\n    }\n    if (Array.isArray(value.breakdowns)) {\n      return value.breakdowns;\n    }\n  }\n  return [];\n};\nconst normalizeSortBy = (value) => {\n  if (!Array.isArray(value)) {\n    return [];\n  }\n\n  const result = [];\n  const seen = new Set();\n\n  for (const item of value) {\n    if (!item || typeof item !== \"object\" || Array.isArray(item)) {\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    const field = String(item.field ?? \"\").trim();\n    if (!field) {\n      continue;\n    }\n\n    const orderText = String(item.order ?? \"asc\").trim().toLowerCase();\n    const order = orderText === \"desc\" || orderText === \"descending\" ? \"desc\" : \"asc\";\n    const key = field.toLowerCase();\n\n    if (!seen.has(key)) {\n      seen.add(key);\n      const sortItem = new Object();\n      sortItem.field = field;\n      sortItem.order = order;\n      result.push(sortItem);\n    }\n  }\n\n  return result;\n};\n\nconst buildState = (input = new Object()) => {\n  const queryResponse = input.queryResponse;\n  const queryPayload = input.queryPayload;\n  const dataResponse = input.dataResponse;\n  const dataPayload = input.dataPayload;\n  const analyticViewNameUsed = input.analyticViewNameUsed;\n  const businessViewNameUsed = input.businessViewNameUsed;\n  const coaBreakdown = input.coaBreakdown;\n  const sortBy = input.sortBy;\n  const resolvedQueryResponse = queryResponse ?? $context.$variables.queryResponse ?? incomingLastUsedQuery.queryResponse ?? new Object();\n  const resolvedQueryPayload = queryPayload ?? $context.$variables.queryPayload ?? incomingLastUsedQuery.queryPayload ?? new Object();\n  const resolvedDataResponse = dataResponse ?? $context.$variables.dataResponse ?? incomingLastUsedData.dataResponse ?? new Object();\n  const resolvedDataPayload = dataPayload ?? $context.$variables.dataPayload ?? incomingLastUsedData.dataPayload ?? new Object();\n  const resolvedCoaBreakdown = normalizeCoaBreakdown(\n    coaBreakdown ?? $context.$variables.coaBreakdown ?? incomingShared.coaBreakdown\n  );\n  const resolvedSortBy = normalizeSortBy(sortBy ?? $context.$variables.sortBy ?? incomingShared.sortBy);\n\n  const summaryView = String(\n    analyticViewNameUsed !== undefined\n      ? analyticViewNameUsed\n      : $context.$variables.analyticViewNameUsed ?? incomingLastUsedQuery.analyticViewNameUsed ?? \"\"\n  );\n  const detailView = summaryView\n    ? \"\"\n    : String(\n        businessViewNameUsed !== undefined\n          ? businessViewNameUsed\n          : $context.$variables.businessViewNameUsed ?? incomingLastUsedQuery.businessViewNameUsed ?? \"\"\n      );\n\n  const lastUsedQuery = new Object();\n  lastUsedQuery.queryResponse = resolvedQueryResponse;\n  lastUsedQuery.queryPayload = resolvedQueryPayload;\n  if (summaryView) {\n    lastUsedQuery.analyticViewNameUsed = summaryView;\n  } else if (detailView) {\n    lastUsedQuery.businessViewNameUsed = detailView;\n  }\n\n  const state = new Object();\n  state.shared = new Object();\n  state.shared.coaBreakdown = resolvedCoaBreakdown;\n  state.shared.sortBy = resolvedSortBy;\n  state.private = new Object();\n  state.private.lastUsedQuery = lastUsedQuery;\n  state.private.lastUsedData = new Object();\n  state.private.lastUsedData.dataResponse = resolvedDataResponse;\n  state.private.lastUsedData.dataPayload = resolvedDataPayload;\n  return state;\n};\n\nconst isEmptyData = (value) => {\n  if (value === null || value === undefined) {\n    return true;\n  }\n  if (typeof value === \"string\") {\n    return value.trim() === \"\";\n  }\n  if (Array.isArray(value)) {\n    return value.length === 0;\n  }\n  if (typeof value === \"object\") {\n    if (value.statusCode === 204) {\n      return true;\n    }\n    if (Array.isArray(value.items)) {\n      return value.items.length === 0;\n    }\n    if (Array.isArray(value.data)) {\n      return value.data.length === 0;\n    }\n    if (Array.isArray(value.rows)) {\n      return value.rows.length === 0;\n    }\n    return Object.keys(value).length === 0;\n  }\n  return false;\n};\n\nconst hasRuntimeError = (value) =>\n  !!(\n    value &&\n    typeof value === \"object\" &&\n    (Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(value, \"errorCode\") ||\n      (Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(value, \"statusCode\") && Number(value.statusCode) >= 300))\n  );\n\nconst detail = $context.$nodes.FIN_GL_BO_FUNCTION_GET_SUMMARY_FILTERS.$output ?? new Object();\nconst getNonEmptyString = (value) => typeof value === \"string\" && value.trim() !== \"\" ? value : \"\";\nconst errorCode = getNonEmptyString(detail.code) ||\n  getNonEmptyString(detail.errorCode) ||\n  \"AV_FILTERS_ERROR\";\nconst errorMessage = getNonEmptyString(detail.message) ||\n  getNonEmptyString(detail.errorMessage) ||\n  \"Your request is missing key context. Please refine your prompt with specific dimension names and values.\";\n\nconst response = new Object();\nresponse.status = \"error\";\nresponse.state = buildState();\nresponse.errorDetails = new Object();\nresponse.errorDetails.code = errorCode;\nresponse.errorDetails.message = errorMessage;\nresponse.errorDetails.detail = detail;\n\nreturn response;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "linear_1045_return_av_filters_error"
          },
          "code": "FIN_GL_CODE_CONSTRUCT_AV_FILTERS_ERROR",
          "id": "linear_1044_construct_av_filters_error",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "description": "Validates selected COA breakdown dimensions against generated query metadata.",
            "errorNodeId": "linear_1305_route_runtime_error_response",
            "name": "Parse Breakdown Dimensions",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "const isObject = (value) => value !== null && typeof value === \"object\" && !Array.isArray(value);\nconst parseObject = (value) => {\n  if (isObject(value)) {\n    return value;\n  }\n  if (typeof value === \"string\" && value.trim() !== \"\") {\n    try {\n      const parsedValue = JSON.parse(value);\n      if (isObject(parsedValue)) {\n        return parsedValue;\n      }\n    } catch (error) {}\n  }\n  const empty = {};\n  return empty;\n};\n\nconst normalizeItems = (value) => {\n  if (Array.isArray(value)) {\n    return value;\n  }\n  if (isObject(value)) {\n    if (Array.isArray(value.breakdowns)) {\n      return value.breakdowns;\n    }\n    if (Array.isArray(value.coaBreakdown)) {\n      return value.coaBreakdown;\n    }\n    if (Array.isArray(value.breakdownBy)) {\n      return value.breakdownBy;\n    }\n  }\n  return [];\n};\n\nconst normalizeExpandLevel = (value) => {\n  const text = String(value ?? \"\").trim().toLowerCase();\n  if (Number(value) === -1 || text === \"leaf\" || text === \"leaves\" || text === \"detail\" || text === \"details\" || text === \"lowest\" || text === \"all\" || text === \"all descendants\") {\n    return -1;\n  }\n  return 1;\n};\n\nconst segments = $context.$variables.queryResponse?.metadata?.chartOfAccounts?.segments ?? {};\nconst allowedDimensions = isObject(segments) ? Object.keys(segments) : [];\nconst selectorOutput = parseObject($context.$nodes.FIN_GL_LLM_BREAKDOWN_DIMENSION_SELECTOR?.$output);\nconst rawItems = normalizeItems(selectorOutput);\nconst byDimension = {};\nconst coaBreakdown = [];\n\nfor (const item of rawItems) {\n  if (!isObject(item)) {\n    continue;\n  }\n  const dimensionName = String(item.dimensionName ?? \"\").trim();\n  const isSegmentKey = allowedDimensions.includes(dimensionName);\n  const isSegmentDimensionName = Object.values(segments).some(\n    (segment) => String(segment?.dimensionName ?? \"\").trim() === dimensionName\n  );\n  if (!isSegmentKey && !isSegmentDimensionName) {\n    continue;\n  }\n  let entry = byDimension[dimensionName];\n  if (!entry) {\n    entry = { dimensionName, expandLevel: normalizeExpandLevel(item.expandLevel), memberNames: [] };\n    byDimension[dimensionName] = entry;\n    coaBreakdown.push(entry);\n  } else if (normalizeExpandLevel(item.expandLevel) === -1) {\n    entry.expandLevel = -1;\n  }\n\n  const sourceMembers = Array.isArray(item.memberNames)\n    ? item.memberNames\n    : typeof item.memberNames === \"string\" && item.memberNames.trim() !== \"\"\n      ? item.memberNames.split(\",\")\n      : [];\n  for (const sourceMember of sourceMembers) {\n    if (sourceMember === null || typeof sourceMember === \"undefined\") {\n      continue;\n    }\n    const memberName = String(sourceMember).trim().replace(/\"/g, \"'\");\n    if (memberName && !entry.memberNames.includes(memberName)) {\n      entry.memberNames.push(memberName);\n    }\n  }\n}\n\nconst res = {\n  breakdownRequired: coaBreakdown.length > 0,\n  coaBreakdown,\n  breakdowns: coaBreakdown,\n  breakdownBy: coaBreakdown\n};\n\nreturn res;"
          },
